OL,3,GNEWSAExtension plans for historic war
OL,4,Atunnels site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn historic World War Two tunnel
OL,7,Fattraction has put forward extension
OL,8,Fplans for its museum and site.
OL,10,FJersey War Tunnels hopes to extend the
OL,11,Fmuseum into the existing car park and
OL,12,Fchange the parking arrangements. It
OL,13,Ffollows a consultation process that
OL,14,Fasked people about improvements they
OL,15,Fwould like to see at the site.
OL,17,FThe hillside tunnels were constructed
OL,18,Fduring World War Two by enslaved
OL,19,Fworkers from across Europe during the
OL,20,FOccupation of the Channel Islands.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
